     A*** BEGIN ADD *** 03/21/94 ***************************************
     A*** ADDITIONAL FIELDS *** MAY BE USED FOR FUTURE PROCESSING
     A******* 5 ALPHA FIELDS
     A            RC5A1     R               REFFLD(DS5)
     A            RC5A2     R               REFFLD(DS5)
     A            RC5A3     R               REFFLD(DS5)
     A            RC5A4     R               REFFLD(DS5)
